    "These are structural proof-time laws installed at their existing semantic owners. They are not newly supplied data or claims of derivation from earlier beta rules alone.",
    "Five typed whole observations use exactly the old terminal expressions, with no enlarged base, new primitive, operational equality-proof parameter or change of general FF laxness.",
